# Adapted from fitzforge/polestar guides/forever/alliance/05-duskwood.guide
# and the Look to the Stars portion of 07-thousand-needles.guide at
# 1775eb81e56fc1e127ae869ccec0b7dc8d7092fd, GPL-3.0-only.
# The precursor quests were accepted in this pack's first Duskwood loop.

step Return to Darkshire
  tip Keep both Dalaran quests and Songblade Search in your log. Fly back to Darkshire from Lakeshire. The two Wetlands dungeon pickups wait until the level-26 trip, before entering Excavation Site; no extra Menethil round trip is needed.
  fly "Darkshire"
  sethome "Darkshire" npc 6790
  turnin 93 optional -- Hand in any saved legs before selling. If not yet complete, finish during the existing cemetery spider work.
  accept 240 lvl 17 optional
  turnin 174
  accept 175 lvl 20

step Darkshire: finish the Stalvan investigation
  tip Smitts, Commander Ebonlocke and Clerk Daltry are all in town. Follow their hand-offs in order. Keep the final combat quest for the higher-level Duskwood chapter after Excavation Site; Stalvan is level 32 and is too strong to rush at 24.
  turnin 78
  accept 79 lvl 22
  turnin 79
  accept 80 lvl 22
  turnin 80
  accept 97 lvl 22
  turnin 97
  accept 98 lvl 22

step Blind Mary
  turnin 175
  accept 177 lvl 20

step The Insane Ghoul
  tip The Insane Ghoul is inside the small crypt at Tranquil Gardens Cemetery. Clear carefully and collect Mary's Looking Glass.
  collect 1946 quest 177

step Viktori Prism'Antras
  turnin 177
  accept 181 lvl 20                           -- Keep this for the later Vul'Gol Ogre Mound visit after Excavation Site; no extra trip now.
  vendor 228 -- Avette Fellwood: sell low-value loot and repair before restocking drinks at the inn.
  vendor 6790 -- Sell and repair nearby; refill Melon Juice at 24 or Sweet Nectar from 25. Reserve travel and training money.
  buy 1708 x20 npc 6790 optional

step Abercrombie
  tip Follow the road west, then go to the hermit's shack north-east of Raven Hill Cemetery.
  turnin 157
  accept 158 lvl 20

step Sven's Camp
  turnin 230
  accept 262 lvl 20
  turnin 226

step Back to Darkshire
  tip Follow the road east to Darkshire. Madame Eva, Clerk Daltry and Tavernkeep Smitts pass you along the same investigation; the quest pickups must be done in this order.
  turnin 262
  accept 265 lvl 20
  turnin 265
  accept 266 lvl 20
  turnin 266
  accept 453 lvl 20
  turnin 158
  accept 156 lvl 20

step Rot Blossoms
  tip Skeletal Horrors on the hillside between Darkshire and Tranquil Gardens Cemetery drop the Rot Blossoms.
  collect 1598 quest 156

step Tavernkeep Smitts
  turnin 156
  accept 159 lvl 20
  vendor nearest

step Abercrombie
  tip Return west to the hermit's shack.
  turnin 159
  accept 133 lvl 20

step Ghoul Ribs
  tip Ghouls in the northern half of Raven Hill Cemetery drop the ribs. Avoid Mor'Ladim.
  collect 884 quest 133

step Abercrombie
  turnin 133

step Jitters
  tip Jitters hides in the house at Raven Hill's west end.
  turnin 240 optional
  turnin 453
  accept 268 lvl 20

step Sven's Camp
  turnin 268

step Continue to the Wetlands outdoor circuit
  note The next chapter fills the leveling gap with explicit harbor, raptor and coastal quests before Excavation Site. Keep the dungeon pickups in your log.
